id: ops-release-quoted-pin-rewrite
title: Refresh and verify quoted release changelog option names
description: "Follow-up to ops-release-1115-heading-drift and pm-ops PR #295. The changelog verifier reads shell option tokens. The reusable prepare workflow and continuation guard still pattern-match raw hook strings, so they can overlook the same option when its name is quoted."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[3]: "area:release",follow-up,"gh:unbraind/pm-ops#295"
created_at: "2026-11-17T19:50:58.644Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-19T11:48:32.408Z"
assignee: codex-sol
claim_principal: codex-sol
author: codex-sol
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: "Exercise the real prepare and continuation paths with quoted option names, quoted date values and equals forms. Both paths must share shell option semantics with the verifier, including ignoring lookalikes inside URL arguments."
severity: high
repro_steps: "At pre-fix revision 60ef4b9, use a hook with \"--date-fallback\" followed by a quoted 2026-11-16 day. Run date-pin refresh and continuation validation with a 2026-11-17 merge day. The shared parser correction first appears in 1304543."
expected_result: "Preparation refreshes or restores each recognized option, and continuation refuses stale pins before publication."
actual_result: "Pre-fix at 60ef4b9: The verifier accepts the shell option. Preparation leaves the stale day in place, and the continuation guard reports no mismatch."
comments[57]:
  - created_at: "2026-11-17T20:49:08.758Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Greptile thread PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M64nxQb on PR #295 identifies a mismatch between the verifier and release handling. Share shell token interpretation across verification, preparation and continuation, with fixtures for quoted option names and rollover."
  - created_at: "2026-11-17T20:53:41.510Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: Red-first fixtures confirmed quoted pins passed the verifier while the prepare step left them stale and the continuation guard accepted them. The shared parser reuses the shell scanner and edits only the option source spans. The workflow exercises quoted pins across a later-day retry and the pre-publication guard.
  - created_at: "2026-11-17T21:00:30.935Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Typecheck, lint, the live date verifier, and tag-backed changelog regeneration and check passed. The follow-up was recovered from its existing tracker commit with the item history intact. Full coverage and the workflow-reference test sweep are running."
