    text: "The pinned-heading acceptance fixture ran the full npm release:check successfully, including npm run coverage at 100% statements, branches, functions and lines across 52 source files. It executed 1715 passing tests with two configured external-repository skips. Typecheck, lint, the live date verifier and tag-backed changelog regeneration and check passed. The isolated artifact-reader retry passed all six tests. The standing-policy full coverage retry is running independently."
  - created_at: "2026-11-17T21:41:39.887Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Greptile follow-up PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M64qrmO on the pushed head identified a regression for version-qualified pm-changelog package specifiers. Cover the verifier, preparation refresh and restore, and continuation check for that existing hook form."
  - created_at: "2026-11-17T21:43:12.064Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "The three version-qualified regressions failed on the first pushed head and passed after adding package specifiers to generator recognition. The fixtures cover an npx version, npm exec version, and a Bun package tag, along with refresh, restore and a stale-pin refusal."
  - created_at: "2026-11-17T21:55:28.198Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Greptile PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M64qrmO maps to 9f41433c9ee493ef35b20879ae64d7c8229c8fc8. The 106 focused verifier and workflow tests passed. Full npm run coverage passed with 1717 passing tests, two configured-repository skips, and 100% statements, branches, functions and lines across 52 sources. Typecheck, lint and tag-backed changelog regeneration and check passed."
  - created_at: "2026-11-18T00:30:33.347Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Round BM starts from the pushed PR head. Extend the shared scanner for wrapper operands, refuse ambiguous changelog commands, and reject unresolved option names across preparation, verification, and continuation."
  - created_at: "2026-11-18T01:03:42.551Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Round BM CodeRabbit mapping. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M64tWD1 maps to f6bdec27de5d8bea97c3369500b38c398ee062c4 for timeout duration operands and explicit refusal of unknown wrappers. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M64tWD9 maps to f6bdec27de5d8bea97c3369500b38c398ee062c4 for refusing unresolved option words in preparation, verification and continuation. On the published Round BL base, the focused suite passed 1,571 tests with two existing opt-in skips. npm run typecheck, npm run lint, npm run docstring, npm run verify:release-changelog-date and the four shell scanner proof scripts passed. npm run coverage passed 2,019 tests with the same two existing skips and 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines across 52 measured sources. git fetch --tags origin, npm run changelog:full and npm run changelog:check passed. npm run accept:packed passed for npm/Node and Bun."
  - created_at: "2026-11-18T01:11:09.777Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "On the Round BM push, CI passed on Node 22 and 26. Greptile identified two compatibility regressions in the parser change. Preserve package-management commands and quoted dynamic values on fixed option names while continuing to refuse unknown wrappers and unresolved date-policy words."
  - created_at: "2026-11-18T01:30:24.276Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Compatibility corrections are in e29526eb7631629ef084c7fb77325478841e4d70. The focused suite passed 1,574 tests with two existing opt-in skips, and the six targeted regressions passed. Typecheck, lint, docstring, duplication, changelog regeneration and verification, the four scanner proof scripts, and packed npm/Node and native Bun acceptance passed. The full coverage gate is running for this commit."
  - created_at: "2026-11-18T02:40:26.059Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: Round BQ reproduced the test guard refusal and confirmed the unknown wrapper control is refused. The prepare script also puts the empty-section option on trailing echo and skips both generators. Add command-level regression fixtures and preserve source text.
  - created_at: "2026-11-18T02:46:12.412Z"
