    text: PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M64vwvQ maps to 5dd95bd. Preparation accepts all seven lookup forms and still refuses an unrecognized executing wrapper. The test -x guard and command execution both have regression fixtures.
  - created_at: "2026-11-18T02:46:13.558Z"
