    text: "PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M64vwvT maps to 5dd95bd. Preparation inserts --include-empty per generator without changing surrounding operators, redirections or already-enabled hooks. The focused preparation and scanner fixtures passed."
  - created_at: "2026-11-18T02:46:15.398Z"
