    text: "Round BW: PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M64zDCx and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M64zDC1 map to 1e51801, with Bun execution switches preserved by 93c0baf. The Bun and pnpm forward fixtures cover pinning and continuation rejection, and the real prepare/check fixture runs with spaces in the Node and generator paths. The first regression selection passed 9 tests. The Bun execution switch and verifier regression selection passed 4 tests, and Bun executed the tested switches in a disposable fixture."
